# ⚙️ 6. Container Process / PID 1

A container normally stays running while its **main process (PID 1)** stays running.

```text
PID 1 RUNNING
      ↓
CONTAINER RUNNING


PID 1 EXITS
      ↓
CONTAINER STOPS
```

Check processes:

```bash
docker top app01
```

Inspect PID:

```bash
docker inspect -f '{{.State.Pid}}' app01
```

