# 🔨 19. Build Time vs Run Time ⭐

```text
┌────────────────┬────────────────┐
│   BUILD TIME   │    RUN TIME    │
├────────────────┼────────────────┤
│ ARG            │ ENV            │
│ RUN            │ CMD            │
└────────────────┴────────────────┘
```

### RUN

```dockerfile
RUN apt-get update
```

Runs during:

```bash
docker build
```

### CMD

```dockerfile
CMD ["python", "app.py"]
```

Runs when:

```bash
docker run
```

### ⭐ Remember

```text
RUN → builds image
CMD → runs application

ARG → build-time value
ENV → runtime/default value
```

