# 👤 21. USER / Permissions

Dockerfile:

```dockerfile
RUN useradd -m -s /bin/bash appuser

COPY . /app

RUN chown -R appuser:appuser /app

USER appuser
```

Check:

```bash
docker exec app01 whoami
```

Correct order:

```text
CREATE USER
     ↓
COPY FILES
     ↓
CHOWN
     ↓
USER appuser
     ↓
RUN APPLICATION
```

> ⚠️ Don't automatically solve permission problems with `chmod 777`.

