# 📂 22. WORKDIR / COPY / .dockerignore

## WORKDIR

```dockerfile
WORKDIR /app
```

Think:

```text
WORKDIR ≈ cd
```

Then:

```dockerfile
COPY app.py .
```

becomes:

```text
/app/app.py
```

---

## COPY

```dockerfile
COPY app.jar /opt/app/app.jar
```

`COPY` happens during image build.

It is **not** a live host/container connection.

For live host sharing use a bind mount.

---

## .dockerignore

Example:

```text
.git
*.log
node_modules
secret.txt
.env
```

Purpose:

```text
Smaller/cleaner build context
+
avoid unnecessary files entering build
```

