# 🪶 24. Image Optimization

Main rules:

```text
✅ Appropriate base image
✅ Only required packages
✅ .dockerignore
✅ Remove package cache
✅ Good layer ordering
✅ Non-root runtime
✅ Multi-stage builds
```

Example:

```dockerfile
RUN apt-get update && \
    apt-get install -y curl && \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
```

Goal:

```text
Smaller image
     +
Faster pull
     +
Cleaner runtime
```

