# 🚨 32. Troubleshooting — Start Here ⭐

When someone says:

> **Application is not working.**

Don't immediately restart it.

Start:

```bash
docker ps -a
```

Then:

```bash
docker logs --tail 100 app01
```

Then:

```bash
docker inspect app01
```

Then:

```bash
docker stats app01 --no-stream
```

Then:

```bash
docker top app01
```

If required:

```bash
docker exec -it app01 sh
```

Test application:

```bash
curl -i http://localhost:9090
```

### ⭐ Troubleshooting Flow

```text
SCENARIO
   ↓
HYPOTHESIS
   ↓
READ-ONLY CHECK
   ↓
ROOT CAUSE
   ↓
FIX
   ↓
VALIDATE
```

