# 🚦 33. Symptom → What to Check

| Problem | First Checks |
|---|---|
| 🔴 Container exited | `ps -a` → logs → ExitCode |
| 🔄 Restarting | logs → CMD → app crash |
| 💥 OOMKilled | OOM → stats → memory limit |
| ❤️ Unhealthy | healthcheck → endpoint |
| 🌐 Website unavailable | ports → logs → listener |
| 🔌 Port conflict | `docker ps` / `docker port` |
| 🌍 Container communication | network → DNS |
| 💾 Data missing | mounts → volumes |
| 👤 Permission denied | USER → ownership |
| 🌱 Wrong config | ENV |
| 📦 Wrong version | image/tag |
| ⚙️ App exits immediately | CMD / ENTRYPOINT |
| 💽 Disk full | `docker system df -v` |

