## ⭐ Final Docker Formula

```text
Dockerfile → Build → Image → Run → Container

Container problem?
        ↓
PS → LOGS → INSPECT → STATS → TOP → EXEC

Communication?
        ↓
PORTS + NETWORK + DNS

Data?
        ↓
VOLUME / BIND MOUNT

Production?
        ↓
NON-ROOT + HEALTH + LIMITS + VERSION TAG

Deployment?
        ↓
BUILD → TAG → PUSH → PULL → RUN
```

> 🐳 **Don't memorize every command. Know what you need to check and which Docker command gives you that information.**
